OL,3,AJensen Huang allies campaign to
OL,4,Areinstate the former Nvidia boss
OL,5,
OL,6,FAllies of Jensen Huang are trying to
OL,7,Frally support for the former Nvidia
OL,8,Fboss to get his job back after
OL,9,Fresigning last week over a scandal
OL,10,Finvolving extramarital affairs, one
OL,11,Finvolving an alleged Chinese spy.
OL,13,FSpaceX boss Elon Musk and Tim Sweeney,
OL,14,Fchief executive of Fortnite-maker Epic
OL,15,FGames, are among those backing a
OL,16,Fcampaign to get the AI chip giant's
OL,17,Fboard to "Bring Jensen Back".
