OL,3,AJensen Huang allies campaign to
OL,4,Areinstate the former Nvidia boss
OL,5,
OL,6,FHuang resigned as chief executive of
OL,7,FNvidia after the emergence of two
OL,8,Faffairs, one of whom was with a woman
OL,9,Fsuspected of spying for China and
OL,10,Fanother allegedly with one of his
OL,11,Femployees.
OL,13,FIt has created a crisis for one of the
OL,14,Fworld's most valuable firms which is a
OL,15,Fkey part of the AI industry and its
OL,16,Fhuge expansion.
